  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Update of Prefeasibility Study - Water Transport Project Study &#x2013; Water Transport Department &#x2013; Mombasa County


Water Transport Project Study &#x2013; Water Transport Department &#x2013; Mombasa County
&#x2022;Request for assistance to update the prefeasibility study that was done for the county in 2014
&#x2022;This will require a new contract for data collection and data analysis to update the information from 10 years ago 
&#x2022; This is to address the current need for the county to introduce a better water transportation system focusing on proposed landing sites and transport networks in the county

Mainly to reduce the heavy road and vehicle usage therefore reducing the polluting from vehicles in the county</narrative>
  </description>
